# Derived, and large. `python3 brand/tools/build.py` rebuilds all three from
# concepts/, and the promoted copy of android/ already lives in the app's own
# res/ tree - tracking it here would be the same bytes twice, with no way to
# tell which of the two a surface is reading.
#
# Anchored with a leading slash, deliberately: `android/` alone also matches
# previous/android/, which silently dropped the backup of the very file this
# directory replaced.
/png/
/android/
/svg/
__pycache__/

# NOT ignored, deliberately: review/contact-sheet.png and index.html are
# generated too, but they are the record of a decision rather than a build
# output, and index.html is what `tailscale serve --set-path=/emulia-brand`
# publishes. A fresh clone should be able to show both without running anything.
